  "question": "What are the yield and selectivity trade-offs between 70 °C and 80 °C in Route 2? Explain using apparent activation energies, reaction orders and competition between TBHP formation and consumption.",
  "scientific_facts": [
    {
      "id": "F1",
      "text": "At the same feed composition, catalyst concentration and 1717.09 s, predicted yield/selectivity is 69.86%/90.46% at 70 °C and 75.51%/86.05% at 80 °C. Yield and selectivity must be compared separately.",
