      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "text": "Main reaction: apparent Ea = 101.142 kJ/mol, ln A = 27.1268, orders catalyst 1.063, H₂O₂ 2.259, TBA 0.514; Side reaction: apparent Ea = 100.250 kJ/mol, ln A = 26.4871, orders catalyst 0.299, TBA 0.253, TBHP 0.953. These parameters describe the calibrated system and do not establish an elementary mechanism.",
      "role": "parameters",
